  "Table has two percentage-of-common-interest columns (residential-only share and building-wide share); pct2 used for the building-wide (second) column, pct for the first. \"Approx. Outdoor Square Footage\" column values shown in the int_sf position for units with a number in that column (e.g., 15A-39C) are actually the outdoor/second-area figures per header; per instructions int_sf holds the \"Approx. Square Footage of Unit\" column and these outdoor figures were placed in sf2 since they don't fit ext_sf per header label \"Outdoor Square Footage\" (kept as sf2=\"outdoor sf\" conceptually, though SF2 label line left blank per uncertainty of exact intended header text).",
